# Unity .gitignore — works whether the Unity project is at the repo root
# OR nested in a subfolder (e.g. fragments/). Based on:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Unity.gitignore
#
# KEY DIFFERENCE vs the stock file: the folder rules below have NO leading slash,
# so they match Library/, Temp/, etc. at ANY depth — including fragments/Library/.

# ── Unity auto-generated folders (the big ones causing 34k files) ──
[Ll]ibrary/
[Tt]emp/
[Oo]bj/
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uilds/
[Ll]ogs/
[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
[Mm]emoryCaptures/
[Rr]ecordings/
.utmp/

# ── Logs / crash reports ──
*.log
sysinfo.txt
mono_crash.*
crashlytics-build.properties

# ── Blender import leftovers ──
*.blend1
*.blend1.meta

# ── IDE / tooling caches (match at any depth) ──
.vs/
.gradle/
.idea/
.consulo/
ExportedObj/
/[Aa]ssets/Plugins/Editor/JetBrains*
**/[Aa]ssets/Plugins/Editor/JetBrains*
*.DotSettings.user

# ── Autogenerated solution / project files ──
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.slnx
*.suo
*.tmp
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.opendb
*.VC.db

# ── Unity-generated meta files for the above (do NOT ignore all .meta!) ──
*.pidb.meta
*.pdb.meta
*.mdb.meta

# ── Builds / packages ──
*.apk
*.aab
*.unitypackage
*.unitypackage.meta
*.app

# ── TestRunner / play-mode auto-generated scenes ──
InitTestScene*.unity*
**/[Aa]ssets/[Ii]nit[Tt]est[Ss]cene*.unity*

# ── Addressables (matched at any depth via **/) ──
/ServerData
**/[Aa]ssets/StreamingAssets/aa*
**/[Aa]ssets/AddressableAssetsData/link.xml*
**/[Aa]ssets/Addressables_Temp*
**/[Aa]ssets/AddressableAssetsData/*/*.bin*

# ── Visual Scripting auto-generated files ──
**/[Aa]ssets/Unity.VisualScripting.Generated/VisualScripting.Flow/UnitOptions.db
**/[Aa]ssets/Unity.VisualScripting.Generated/VisualScripting.Flow/UnitOptions.db.meta
**/[Aa]ssets/Unity.VisualScripting.Generated/VisualScripting.Core/Property Providers
**/[Aa]ssets/Unity.VisualScripting.Generated/VisualScripting.Core/Property Providers.meta

# ── Auto-generated cache in Assets ──
**/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]ceneDependencyCache*

# ── OS / editor junk (the "Global" ignores your header referenced) ──
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
# .vscode/   # uncomment to stop sharing VS Code settings